{%- comment -%}
  Nessclusive homepage.

  A .liquid template with static {% section %} tags, deliberately NOT
  templates/index.json. A JSON template lets the merchant reorder, delete, and
  duplicate sections from the customizer — someone could drop the hero or push
  testimonials above the fold. Static sections still expose every setting for
  editing, but the running order is fixed here in code.

  That is the mechanism behind the Editability policy. See PLAN.md, Decision #12.

  Order matches the prototype, lines 102-288.
{%- endcomment -%}

